Package: oochroot
Version: 0.2.0-1
Section: utils
Priority: optional
Architecture: amd64
Maintainer: openOODA-tools <ops@openooda.org>
Depends: libc6
Description: ROOT JAIL
 Sets up capability-bounded root filesystem jail with pivot_root semantics.
 Capability-bounded openOODA utility with zero ambient authority,
 systemd container confinement synthesis, and native Model Context Protocol (MCP) surface.
